# Shared integration ownership

Reusable integration logic lives in `@eden-ecommerce/lib`, not under this monorepo’s app `lib/` or `hooks/` when that path already exists as a published subpath.

## Put in `@eden-ecommerce/lib`

APIs, GROQ getters, env guards, shared client hooks, formatters, loaders (`loaders/*`). Import `@eden-ecommerce/lib/<subpath>`.

## Keep in this monorepo

Studio features, domain, services, in-repo `packages/plugins/*` / `packages/libraries/*`, and UI that wires **local** controls or design slots.

## Adding a shared integration

1. Implement in lib → publish `lib-vX.Y.Z` → consumer exact pin bump in `package.json`.
2. App owns composition only — do not copy hooks/types into the app to bypass lib.
3. Design stays props-only; loaders and third-party SDKs stay in lib (slots into design).

Never shadow a published `@eden-ecommerce/lib/...` export with a same-path local file.
